      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 mb-6" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">
        {[
          { t: 'American Academy of Ophthalmology EyeWiki: Computer Vision Syndrome (Digital Eye Strain) (accommodation and vergence, blinking, uncorrected presbyopia, the 20-20-20 rule)', u: 'https://eyewiki.org/Computer_Vision_Syndrome_(Digital_Eye_Strain)' },
          { t: 'American Academy of Ophthalmology: Computers, Digital Devices and Eye Strain (fewer blinks at screens, looking away into the distance, screen about an arm\'s length away and slightly below eye level)', u: 'https://www.aao.org/eye-health/tips-prevention/computer-usage' },
