      <p class="text-brand-ink-2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8">Blinking, the 20-20-20 rule and screen placement follow EyeWiki and the American Academy of Ophthalmology's public education materials; the extra 1.67 D at 60 cm is a distance calculation (1 ÷ 0.6 m). What each store measures and which lenses it can fit have been checked item by item with our stores. Dry eye, ocular-surface and tear-film tests and diagnosis should be done by an ophthalmologist. Last updated: 28 October 2026.</p>
